{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09410","headline":"野居 · 韦应物","name":"野居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结发屡辞秩，立身本疎慢。\n今得罢守归，幸无世欲患。\n栖止且偏僻，嬉游无早晏。\n逐兔上坡冈，捕鱼缘赤涧。\n高歌意气在，贳酒贫居惯。\n时啓北窗扉，岂将文墨间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09410.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09410","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}